    {
      "v": "timur",
      "t": "У меня все продукты свежие.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All of my produce is completely fresh.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Давай, до свидания.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, goodbye then.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "timur",
      "t": "Подпись поставил.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He already put his signature on it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Ее нет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She is nowhere to be found.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "timur",
      "t": "Что, тебе ребенка доверили, а ты что?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What, we entrusted our child to you, and what did you do?'",
      "gap": 0.45
